WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
This is Scotty, a fictional space-travel booking app.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.720
Let’s plan a trip, choose a ride, and follow the

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:07.200
journey.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.520
Start with Find a ride.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.480
The map stays visible while you set your pickup and

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:13.280
destination.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:16.800
For this walkthrough, we’re traveling from Earth to Vulcan.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.360
Check the travel date and departure time.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:22.200
These times are shown in U T C.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.880
Choose a service, then select Choose spacecraft.

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.960
Here you can compare a private ship with a shared

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.000
rocket bus.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.760
Private fares cover the ship.

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:34.160
Bus fares are shown per seat.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:37.440
Use the Rocket bus filter to narrow the list, then

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:40.480
compare the fare, available seats, and pilot.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:43.760
Before choosing, open Read reviews.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.720
You can see the pilot’s rating and comments from previous

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:47.440
passengers.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:50.000
These reviews are fictional examples.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:54.000
Select Travel with Jean-Luc Picard to choose this ride.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:57.560
You can also inspect the spacecraft in three dimensions.

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.240
Drag to turn the model and see its shape from

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:01.280
different angles.

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.760
Close the inspection to return to your booking.

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.000
Next, review the journey.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:10.240
Check the destination, pilot, departure window, and fare.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:14.240
When the details look right, select Proceed to checkout.

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:18.160
At checkout, choose Scotty travel credits and review the total.

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:22.280
Tick the confirmation box, then select Confirm booking.

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:24.000
This is a demonstration.

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:25.840
No real payment is taken.

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:29.040
When your vessel is ready, select Begin journey.

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:32.280
Watch the selected craft move along the route.

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:35.200
Travel is accelerated for the demo, so you can see

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:38.480
departure and arrival without waiting for a real trip.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:44.840
After arrival, open My trips to see the completed journey.

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:47.840
You can plan another voyage, switch to the Earth street

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:50.560
map, or explore the Solar System.

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:53.360
That’s the full Scotty booking walkthrough.
